{"text": "Later that morning I climbed to the top of the mountain to look for a search party. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But all I saw was a quiet valley and one farmer plowing a field with a mule. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Perhaps they have not noticed yet that the boy is missing, I said to myself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When I returned to the cave, I found Bill backed against the wall, breathing hard. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boy had put a hot boiled potato down his back, and now he was holding a big rock. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then the boy took a sling out of his pocket and shot a stone at Bill. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It hit him behind the left ear so hard that he fell over beside the fire. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You will not go away and leave me here alone, will you, Sam, Bill asked weakly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I told the boy that I would take him straight home if he did not behave. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boy quickly promised to be good, as long as he could play the Black Scout that day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then Bill and I sat down to write a letter to old Dorset, asking for a ransom.", "alignment": {"characters": ["L", "a", "t", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "I", " ", "c", "l", "i", "m", "b", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "o", "p", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "u", "n", "t", "a", "i", "n", " ", "t", "o", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "a", " ", "s", "e", "a", "r", "c", "h", " ", "p", "a", "r", "t", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "I", " ", "s", "a", "w", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "q", "u", "i", "e", "t", " ", "v", "a", "l", "l", "e", "y", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "f", "a", "r", "m", "e", "r", " ", "p", "l", "o", "w", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", " ", "f", "i", "e", "l", "d", "